<h1 local-id=3D"86db6482-a9e2-4aed-a843-aa88ec34f40e" id=3D"Dev|Programmier=
richtlinienerweitern(sprachunabh=C3=A4ngigeProgrammierung)-TranslationsDict=
ionaryviaInfosystemSMARTTRANS">Translations Dictionary via Infosystem SMART=
TRANS</h1>
<p local-id=3D"ed416bde-ad23-407f-859c-a0ad2353b8af">There are two differen=
t types of texts that must be translated using the dictionary:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"5377bf84-850a-4a22-94ad-43748399ca15">
<li local-id=3D"1fecad2c-3ff0-4a24-aad5-185efa6ea6cb">
<p local-id=3D"b2b8d394-9baf-4944-a396-36c90cf85708">Texts for operability =
(operating language)</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"98e81265-d867-47d7-adda-6b9274588b15">
<li local-id=3D"dd613e4a-deef-4b2d-877e-98dc75d92bb9">
<p local-id=3D"cdd950c9-56c4-4d43-af55-5868d849ebf8">Texts for external com=
munication (correspondence language)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"19ccb05b-2e1f-46dd-8cdc-bf4ba4314a94">The activated operatin=
g and correspondence languages are set in the configuration dataset (Master=
 Data &gt; Company Master &gt; Application &gt; Show Configuration).</p><sp=
an class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-=
embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-left" a=
lt=3D"grafik-20260127-101359.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"922=
fedc3a63e38499ce5a75626c85834439d49d21d54444175effc33618f0609" data-image-s=
