<p local-id=3D"0c26a632-759b-465b-afe3-ec4a061783d4">In the example, three =
operating languages (the languages that can be chosen as user languages whe=
n starting abas) are configured:<br>
German, English, and French.<br>
Various correspondence languages are stored.</p>
<p local-id=3D"94925723-0ea8-499e-a441-1eea49594050">Translation of the ope=
rating language:<br>
If a screen output is generated in a program, e.g. via a box, or a text for=
 a print output is created, it must be included in the dictionary for trans=
lation of the output text.<br>
This ensures that the foreign user sees their output in the corresponding o=
perating language and the correct translation is guaranteed on forms.</p>
<p local-id=3D"ac32f5a7-3da9-41e4-af83-c87438ea7d57">FOP:<br>
ow1/FS.FO2</p>
<p local-id=3D"405cf02b-0884-4dd3-88a2-29638fc7424c">Wrong:</p><span class=
