<h1 local-id=3D"9f9aba9b-d133-469b-9de9-16c7910a10c3" id=3D"Dev|Programmier=
richtlinienerweitern(sprachunabh=C3=A4ngigeProgrammierung)-FOPLanguageinCon=
figurationDataset">FOP Language in Configuration Dataset</h1>
<p local-id=3D"37269a13-1f74-45be-8d64-1d49799db643">(Master Data &gt; Comp=
any Master &gt; Application &gt; Show Configuration)<br>
The FOP language specifies whether the FOP commands use German or English t=
erminology<br>
(Note: this can be overridden per FOP by the interpreter in line 1).<br>
If no interpreter line is present, the setting stored in the configuration =
is expected.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"17aef9b6-84da-4acd-bab3-35b6fd38a5a7" id=3D"Dev|Programmier=
richtlinienerweitern(sprachunabh=C3=A4ngigeProgrammierung)-InterpreterLine"=
>Interpreter Line</h1>
<p local-id=3D"d641fdb8-2f69-4f3c-b99f-8d0623159545">Example:<br>
..!interpreter english declaration noabbrev</p>
<p local-id=3D"e5866c7f-9099-4641-a878-14dab1badaa2">Possible options:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"37fb9d0d-5702-4292-bfe2-9d1472184c1a">
<li local-id=3D"964c8dc5-40d0-4e1f-806a-40e04460cdde">
<p local-id=3D"4f894f4f-0480-4464-93ea-a0c80fc889e2">english/german<br>
Specifies whether English or German FO commands are used</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"4d9eef22-9e4f-4684-b40e-1c098698abfa">
<li local-id=3D"0d8466bc-41c1-4965-bc4a-9c9b71eee4c2">
<p local-id=3D"c639f348-5191-48cd-be77-b1fa45c4bc87">declaration<br>
Indicates that all U| - variables must be declared</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"3b564ccc-eea7-474b-af8e-df74f6aeab7d">
<li local-id=3D"69317221-09bd-4318-b070-2e48913f5b15">
<p local-id=3D"9eabd390-754c-496f-9117-512eb1e533f3">noabbrev<br>
Prevents abbreviation of variables</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"cc3ef5fb-b5a7-40df-8e6a-60267727b1bf">
<li local-id=3D"b36654c5-0248-479a-9300-7f6b02ae1fba">
<p local-id=3D"77b0f432-a9d9-49c6-a902-d6f3b8c5641a">englvar<br>
Indicates that all variables must be addressed with English variable names,=
 but this option should <u>not</u> be used.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0a9480cf-bc69-4e93-8a82-8046dae24d21"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"7b635f82-6373-4860-b0aa-3f6adb20bc83" id=3D"Dev|Programmier=
richtlinienerweitern(sprachunabh=C3=A4ngigeProgrammierung)-EventCommands">E=
vent Commands</h1>
<p local-id=3D"5b2981c1-74f7-4272-9b5b-eb4f64dc4e21">The event commands "ne=
w", "show", "change", etc. must be mapped language-independently.<br>
For this, there is an array in the standard: "kaktname"<br>
Alternatively, the standard program "KAKTNAME.KONST" can be included and us=
ed.<br>
Example: Event command "new"</p>
<p local-id=3D"ada1d679-a14c-47e8-84d6-4fdb9031ef2c">Wrong:<br>
G|evtkommd =3D "neu"</p>
<p local-id=3D"35f89b2e-6a8a-4c9d-8e5c-23722df9b23f">Correct:<br>
G|evtkommd =3D G|kaktname14<br>
G|evtkommd =3D G|kaktname.koaktNEU</p>
<p local-id=3D"6beb4929-4fbf-49a6-9796-3cb5657de6e5"></p>
