<p local-id=3D"e8b9cc79-1f52-4acd-8bfb-c9f3af944b7d"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"f2ff83ae-141a-41ce-921d-dea3d57c40d1" id=3D"Dev|Programmier=
richtlinienerweitern(sprachunabh=C3=A4ngigeProgrammierung)-Databases">Datab=
ases</h1>
<p local-id=3D"4027e787-9e38-4ab1-896b-2629c75f0fcd">Databases must also be=
 addressed language-independently.<br>
The standard offers the array "hdatname" for this.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5c6bcc4c-3794-41b8-8c50-50806d21b30c">German:<br>
.lade 0 keinsperre Verkauf 'U|xTsel'</p>
<p local-id=3D"5894cf63-6832-4723-abee-bd6a884ebe92">English:<br>
.load 0 nolock Sales 'U|xTsel'</p>
<p local-id=3D"ae0b77f5-c609-4c64-a966-9f6beb402c00">Language-independent v=
ia array G|hdatname<br>
.load 0 'G|hdatname3' nolock 'U|xTsel'</p>
<p local-id=3D"362b0dd3-8b73-4480-bd55-fc18995585b8"></p>
<p local-id=3D"9661fff4-558e-4aa5-b7e5-3fae69c4e575">The index of the array=
 is the database number in abas.<br>
Examples:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
